  "label": "User projected onto the man presenting baked goods",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the central visual material (the man) who is presenting the baked goods with pride. The text 'voila! fresh batch of baked goods!' reinforces this projection by framing the man's action as a successful accomplishment to be celebrated, inviting the user to share in his satisfaction. The meme's celebratory tone and the man's direct gaze toward the viewer create an implicit 'you' or 'me' connection, where the user is invited to identify with the presenter's pride and achievement.",
